  "details": "Interaction tips near hands and objects aren't localized.\n\nPics related.\n\nAs I remember, \"Use\" and \"Equip\" can be overridden in SDK, but I not sure about other strings.\n\nAnyways, by default, if content creator doesn't override these strings,\n\nit should be localizable out-of-the-box. \n\nIt's important as it's one of the main interactions on the app that regular users meet.\n\nShould be treated as localizations of controls.\n\nhttps://discord.com/channels/1096246414603997194/1156077879814279208/1392179934512021504",
